# Conformance probe pack whose inner line, naming a format no pack declares,
# lies in one kind only (spec 0.34, Reaching the inner line: a line not
# reached checks nothing). Most significant bit first. Public.
#
#   byte 0      the kind: 1 = good, 2 = gone
#   kind good   n in 8 bits
#   kind gone   w in 8 bits, then the inner message (unknown-format)
format     conformance-inner-unreached
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
kind good
when     8  1
requires probe.n
field    probe.n  8  uint
kind gone
when     8  2
requires probe.w
field    probe.w  8  uint
inner    conformance-inner-not-a-format
